        "type": "game",
        "name": "Arya's Blade",
        "steam_appid": 3161170,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that has seen humanity rise and fall countless times, take on the role of Divya in a story to find the hope for survival of her tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across landscapes, filled with remnants of time passed, trying to understand a world that seems too bizarre to be real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arya's Blade is a Metroidvania-style, fast-paced hack-and-slash game with physics-based combat and platforming. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Divya's full potential by exploiting her speed, agility, and momentum to leave a devastating impact on your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming is not just about timing in Arya's Blade. Use your momentum and exploit physics to overcome challenges that seem impossible otherwise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain a deep understanding of your own capabilities and of the world and master a broad skillset to ensure your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come across people who will leave an everlasting impact on your story, shaping it together with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter variety of flora and fauna, encountering a wide range of foes. Vanquish them to continue your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an interconnected world, sometimes in space but others in time, be the hope for the survival of your tribe.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that has seen humanity rise and fall countless times, take on the role of Divya in a story to find the hope for survival of her tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across landscapes, filled with remnants of time passed, trying to understand a world that seems too bizarre to be real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arya's Blade is a Metroidvania-style, fast-paced hack-and-slash game with physics-based combat and platforming. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Divya's full potential by exploiting her speed, agility, and momentum to leave a devastating impact on your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming is not just about timing in Arya's Blade. Use your momentum and exploit physics to overcome challenges that seem impossible otherwise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain a deep understanding of your own capabilities and of the world and master a broad skillset to ensure your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come across people who will leave an everlasting impact on your story, shaping it together with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter variety of flora and fauna, encountering a wide range of foes. Vanquish them to continue your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an interconnected world, sometimes in space but others in time, be the hope for the survival of your tribe.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A physics based, fast paced Hack and Slash game set in a world where the lines between past, present and future have blurred",
        "supported_languages": "English",
